      "value": "信号（Signal Browser Definition）：Average return in the same month over the preceding 2-5 years. 组合规则（该页字段）：StockWeight=EW；LSQuantile=0.1；PortfolioPeriod=1.0个月；StartMonth=6.0；Sign=1.0；TestInOP=port sort。股票池/过滤：exchcd%in%c(1,2)。 Notes：Perhaps one should only include this signal from Heston and Sadka. Certainly one shouldn't have 5 flavors of seasonal momentum, and on top of that 5 flavors of the off-season. We include all of this to nest HXZ, however. And technically, all of these strategies are found in the paper.。 基线为原论文分组的多空组合（FAQ：baseline follows the original paper split；数据页写 monthly long-short following OPs）。未在该行写出的细节不补。"
